      "relation_type": "direct_action",
      "relation_subtype": "definitional",
      "confidence": 0.8,
      "sentence": "Several synthetic plain-text-to-KG extractors have been proposed to address KG scarcity, most\nprominently including OpenIE [Angeli et al., 2015] and Microsoft’s GraphRAG"
